{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"077b2a1ddc2b668ac77c661d14785bb9b3082ad50fde4c3c0dc2a7405994cac0","ja":"これって……SNS？\n「表参道にソルがいる」……って……。","zh":"这难道是……社交平台？\n“表参道有索尔”……什么的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
