{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"527d06b2fe1d3f46f386e0f3c345e2fb8d257d146936ee0a2c4a06f1e5869f1f","ja":"「わぁ♪　TVで見るよりもっとカワイイ！」\n「サインもらったりできないかな……？」","zh":"“哇♪　比在电视上看到的还要可爱！”\n“能不能跟她要到签名呢……？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3c3221df45ff0763026df875cccf6d36f393e053e29da69d95859001cd690df1","ja":"はわわっ！　周りに人がたくさん\n集まってきちゃいました！","zh":"哇哇！周围聚集了好多\n人呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"4dad239e5c014f709fc6a3312886ac365485161a3171f28bdf45d6ba275c34b0","ja":"いや～、人気者はつらいね～♪","zh":"哎呀～太受欢迎也是件辛苦事呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"55ca0a79fc9e1314e0f32506a1195046e676a36382149b892d70f82da7c63960","ja":"ここはあきらめた方が良さそうね……。\nみんな、騒ぎが大きくなる前に離れるわよ！","zh":"这里还是放弃比较好吧……\n大家，趁事情闹大前快离开！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"38bd563647afa824a3b8c8c2761fc023815c1a6932fe86ecd3cde0f93f8972e1","ja":"「……あっ、ソルのメンバーだ！」\n「ねえ、こっちこっち！」","zh":"「……啊，是太阳队的成员！」\n「喂，这边这边！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"47fafab33235f13a9b4df38f839c0b2d4ac4f8eb89b1f978a3c1d740576b4174","ja":"ここもだめっぽいよ！\n亜美たちがこの辺りにいること、バレちゃってる！","zh":"这里好像也不行哦！\n亚美她们在这附近的事，已经暴露了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"01d8ab775ad5270838440205aeab59081fc178a1232eda91895c9914d4177ef9","ja":"「本当にこっちに来た！」\n「ね、私の予想、ぴったりだったでしょ♪」","zh":"“真的来这边了！”\n“看吧，我的预测完全没错吧♪”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"dea3529a0e244ffb3233b8697825b83fe6c96dcfd2a0841cb8f7bdda4d049445","ja":"うあうあー！\n真美たちのこと、待ち構えてる人がいるよー！","zh":"呜哇呜哇——！\n有人正等着真美她们呢——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[63].text","source_sha256":"9d5adfa884192fb971c4eae66764cf70b4a5d8951a53695bff83b9985917aa27","ja":"「ねえねえ、ソルの人たち見つけた？」\n「こっちに来たって投稿はあるんだけど……」","zh":"“喂喂，找到太阳队的人了吗？”\n“虽然有发帖说往这边来了……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[64].text","source_sha256":"990508ea5e27831a938b4e16ad17a6e51345cc1992fe6b27b16252c2447c11f1","ja":"むう……ここもダメみたいなの。","zh":"唔……这里好像也不行呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[65].text","source_sha256":"d4ca29940be3dec3476def017ed1aa4ed2e1e096550281b5c87d9f6746a03446","ja":"SNSの弊害ね……！\nこんなに話題になってるのはうれしいけど……。","zh":"这就是社交平台的弊端呢……！\n虽然引发了这么高的话题度是很让人开心啦……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1375.unity3d","item_key":"commands[66].text","source_sha256":"408b9e6ed1e119120ec125eeca747ce8ef7a5cde62b9087d525f8b676c144df8","ja":"さすがに今日は、外で食べるのは難しそうね。\n一度、劇場に戻りましょう。","zh":"今天果然不太能在外面吃呢。\n先回剧场一趟吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
